{
  "name": "Channel Divinity: Balm of Peace",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use your Channel Divinity to make your very presence a soothing balm. As an Action, you can move up to your Speed, without provoking Opportunity Attacks, and when you move within 5 feet of any other creature during this action, you can restore a number of hit points to that creature equal to 2d6 + your Wisdom modifier (minimum of 1 hit point). A creature can receive this healing only once whenever you take this action.</p>",
